rk>Wondershare Filmora</mark> keyboard shortcuts","intro_markdown":"Filmora publishes complete Windows and Mac shortcut tables for file actions, editing, timeline navigation, markers, playback, and export.","content_markdown":"<!-- section:print -->\n## Print the shortcuts you use\n\n[Make a printable Wondershare Filmora sheet](/shortcuts-cheatsheet-generator?apps=wondershare-filmora)"},{"slug":"keyboard-shortcuts/wordpress-admin","title":"<mark>WordPress Admin</mark> keyboard shortcuts","intro_markdown":"WordPress publishes keyboard references for the Block Editor, Classic Editor, comments, and Site Editor. This map keeps those admin editing surfaces together and does not claim shortcuts for every plugin screen.","content_markdown":"<!-- section:print -->\n## Print the shortcuts you use\n\n[Make a printable WordPress Admin sheet](/shortcuts-cheatsheet-generator?apps=wordpress-admin)"},{"slug":"keyboard-shortcuts/wps-office","title":"<mark>WPS Office</mark> keyboard shortcuts","intro_markdown":"WPS publishes product-specific shortcut tables for Writer, Spreadsheets, Presentation, and the Mac app. This reference keeps the Windows document tools separate from the Mac commands.","content_markdown":"<!-- section:print -->\n## Print the shortcuts you use\n\n[Make a printable WPS Office sheet](/shortcuts-cheatsheet-generator?apps=wps-office)"},{"slug":"keyboard-shortcuts/wrike","title":"<mark>Wrike</mark> keyboard shortcuts","intro_markdown":"Wrike publishes shortcuts for task creation, search, comments, text formatting, table views, and Gantt chart navigation.","content_markdown":"<!-- section:print -->\n## Print the shortcuts you use\n\n[Make a printable Wrike sheet](/shortcuts-cheatsheet-generator?apps=wrike)"},{"slug":"keyboard-shortcuts/x-twitter","title":"<mark>X (Twitter)</mark> keyboard shortcuts","intro_markdown":"X publishes keyboard shortcuts for posts, timeline navigation, search, direct messages, profile areas, and other common actions on x.com.","content_markdown":"<!-- section:print -->\n## Print the shortcuts you use\n\n[Make a printable X (Twitter) sheet](/shortcuts-cheatsheet-generator?apps=x-twitter)"},{"slug":"keyboard-shortcuts/youtrack","title":"<mark>YouTrack</mark> keyboard shortcuts","intro_markdown":"YouTrack Cloud publishes keyboard tables for issue lists, single issues, rich text, and whiteboards. This reference keeps those contexts separate.","content_markdown":"<!-- section:print -->\n## Print the shortcuts you use\n\n[Make a printable YouTrack sheet](/shortcuts-cheatsheet-generator?apps=youtrack)"},{"slug":"keyboard-shortcuts/youtube","title":"<mark>YouTube</mark> keyboard shortcuts","intro_markdown":"YouTube publishes desktop player shortcuts for playback, seeking, captions, chapters, speed, volume, search, and playlist navigation.","content_markdown":"<!-- section:print -->\n## Print the shortcuts you use\n\n[Make a printable YouTube sheet](/shortcuts-cheatsheet-generator?apps=youtube)"},{"slug":"keyboard-shortcuts/zbrush","title":"<mark>ZBrush</mark> keyboard shortcuts","intro_markdown":"Maxon publishes ZBrush's default keyboard shortcuts by category, including project files, palettes, sculpting controls, masking, subtools, and rendering.","content_markdown":"<!-- section:print -->\n## Print the shortcuts you use\n\n[Make a printable ZBrush sheet](/shortcuts-cheatsheet-generator?apps=zbrush)"},{"slug":"keyboard-shortcuts/zed","title":"<mark>Zed</mark> keyboard shortcuts","intro_markdown":"Zed's default keymap is built around moving quickly through an editor, workspace, terminal, and agent panel. This reference covers the current built-in defaults across macOS, Linux, and Windows, including the context-sensitive keys that are most useful in daily work.","content_markdown":"<!-- section:print -->\n## Print the shortcuts you use\n\n[Make a printable Zed sheet](/shortcuts-cheatsheet-generator?apps=zed)"},{"slug":"keyboard-shortcuts/zen-browser","title":"<mark>Zen Browser</mark> keyboard shortcuts","intro_markdown":"Zen Browser publishes a current desktop shortcut reference for compact mode, workspaces, split views, tabs, navigation, search, pages, and developer tools.","content_markdown":"<!-- section:print -->\n## Print the shortcuts you use\n\n[Make a printable Zen Browser sheet](/shortcuts-cheatsheet-generator?apps=zen-browser)"},{"slug":"keyboard-shortcuts/zendesk","title":"<mark>Zendesk</mark> keyboard shortcuts","intro_markdown":"Zendesk publishes an Agent Workspace keyboard cheat sheet for navigation, ticket actions, status changes, and composing replies or internal notes.","content_markdown":"<!-- section:print -->\n## Print the shortcuts you use\n\n[Make a printable Zendesk sheet](/shortcuts-cheatsheet-generator?apps=zendesk)"},{"slug":"keyboard-shortcuts/zeplin","title":"<mark>Zeplin</mark> keyboard shortcuts","intro_markdown":"Zeplin publishes separate Mac and Windows app shortcuts for projects, styleguides, screens, sections, tags, layers, and zoom.","content_markdown":"<!-- section:print -->\n## Print the shortcuts you use\n\n[Make a printable Zeplin sheet](/shortcuts-cheatsheet-generator?apps=zeplin)"},{"slug":"keyboard-shortcuts/zoom","title":"<mark>Zoom</mark> keyboard shortcuts","intro_markdown":"Zoom publishes current desktop shortcuts for meetings, chat, calls, product navigation, and accessibility controls across Windows, macOS, and Linux.","content_markdown":"<!-- section:print -->\n## Print the shortcuts you use\n\n[Make a printable Zoom sheet](/shortcuts-cheatsheet-generator?apps=zoom)"},{"slug":"keyboard-shortcuts/zulip","title":"<mark>Zulip</mark> keyboard shortcuts","intro_markdown":"Zulip publishes a current Web and Desktop keyboard reference for streams, topics, direct messages, search, composing, and message actions.","content_markdown":"<!-- section:print -->\n## Print the shortcuts you use\n\n[Make a printable Zulip sheet](/shortcuts-cheatsheet-generator?apps=zulip)"}]$copy$::jsonb)
  as copy(slug text,title text,intro_markdown text,content_markdown text)
join public.stack127_pages page on page.slug=copy.slug and page.page_family='directory';

-- Database-backed child copy comes from its existing records.
insert into public.stack127_directory_pages (page_id,title,intro_markdown,content_markdown,card_name,card_description)
select page.id,network.name || ' publisher websites',
  coalesce(network.summary,'Browse publisher websites with a verified ' || network.name || ' relationship.') || ' A site can use more than one ad network.',
  'A site appears here only when its current ads.txt or live configuration supports the stated relationship. A seller authorization alone does not establish active use.',
  page.label,page.meta_description
from public.ad_networks network join public.stack127_pages page
  on page.slug='ad-networks/' || network.slug and page.page_family='directory';

insert into public.stack127_directory_pages (page_id,title,intro_markdown,card_name,card_description)
select page.id,section.meta_title,section.intro,page.label,page.meta_description
from public.platform_fee_sections section
left join jsonb_to_recordset($paths$[{"id":"watch-apps-watch-faces-and-device-themes","slug":"watch-apps-and-themes"},{"id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations","slug":"app-marketplaces"},{"id":"software-saas-and-api-marketplaces","slug":"software-marketplaces"},{"id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services","slug":"software-checkout"},{"id":"datasets-and-ai-training-data","slug":"datasets"},{"id":"digital-download-stores-and-marketplaces","slug":"digital-downloads"},{"id":"online-stores-and-checkout-tools","slug":"online-stores"},{"id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets","slug":"design-assets"},{"id":"website-themes-and-templates","slug":"website-templates"},{"id":"productivity-templates-and-ui-kits","slug":"templates-and-ui-kits"},{"id":"source-code-scripts-and-developer-components","slug":"code-marketplaces"},{"id":"3d-models-materials-and-textures","slug":"3d-models"},{"id":"game-mods-worlds-and-virtual-items","slug":"game-mods-and-items"},{"id":"photos-and-stock-images","slug":"stock-photos"},{"id":"stock-video-and-motion-templates","slug":"stock-video"},{"id":"stock-music-sound-effects-and-sample-packs","slug":"stock-audio"},{"id":"music-sales-and-distribution","slug":"music-distribution"},{"id":"ebooks-and-print-books","slug":"books"},{"id":"comics-and-serialized-fiction","slug":"comics-and-fiction"},{"id":"courses-and-workshops-with-a-marketplace","slug":"course-marketplaces"},{"id":"tutoring-and-live-teaching","slug":"tutoring"},{"id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms","slug":"course-platforms"},{"id":"teaching-resources-and-worksheets","slug":"teaching-resources"},{"id":"online-event-and-workshop-tickets","slug":"event-tickets"},{"id":"sewing-knitting-and-craft-patterns","slug":"craft-patterns"},{"id":"paid-communities-and-memberships","slug":"communities"},{"id":"fan-subscriptions-and-exclusive-content","slug":"fan-subscriptions"},{"id":"newsletters-and-paid-writing","slug":"newsletters"},{"id":"video-and-livestream-creators","slug":"video-creators"},{"id":"selling-video-subscriptions-rentals-and-downloads","slug":"video-sales"},{"id":"podcast-subscriptions-and-monetization","slug":"podcasts"},{"id":"tips-and-creator-support","slug":"tips"},{"id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions","slug":"coaching"},{"id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions","slug":"freelance-services"},{"id":"crowdfunding-creative-projects","slug":"crowdfunding"},{"id":"ai-prompts-and-paid-ai-creations","slug":"ai-creations"},{"id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand","slug":"merch-and-print-on-demand"},{"id":"payment-links-and-processing","slug":"payments"}]$paths$::jsonb) as route(id text,slug text) on route.id=section.id
join public.stack127_pages page on page.slug='platform-fees/' || coalesce(route.slug,section.id) and page.page_family='directory';

insert into public.stack127_directory_pages (page_id,title,intro_markdown,card_name,card_description)
select page.id,'Platform fees compared: ' || (select count(*) from public.platform_fee_entries) || ' platforms across ' || (select count(*) from public.platform_fee_sections) || ' categories',
  'Choose what you sell, then compare fees and start costs. Open a card for other rates and official sources. Ranges use headline percentages before fixed charges and other deductions.',
  page.label,page.meta_description from public.stack127_pages page where page.slug='platform-fees' and page.page_family='directory';

do $$
begin
  if exists (select 1 from public.stack127_pages page where page.page_family='directory' and page.is_published
    and not exists (select 1 from public.stack127_directory_pages content where content.page_id=page.id)) then
    raise exception 'Published directory pages are missing their copy backfill';
  end if;
end;
$$;

create function public.stack127_touch_directory_content()
returns trigger language plpgsql set search_path=pg_catalog as $$
begin
  if tg_op='UPDATE' and (to_jsonb(new)-'row_updated_at') is not distinct from (to_jsonb(old)-'row_updated_at') then return null; end if;
  if tg_op<>'INSERT' then
    update public.stack127_pages set updated_at=case when is_published then now() else null end where id=old.page_id;
    perform public.stack127_enqueue_revalidation('page', (select slug from public.stack127_pages where id=old.page_id), 'directory_content');
  end if;
  if tg_op<>'DELETE' then
    update public.stack127_pages set updated_at=case when is_published then now() else null end where id=new.page_id;
    perform public.stack127_enqueue_revalidation('page', (select slug from public.stack127_pages where id=new.page_id), 'directory_content');
  end if;
  return null;
end;
$$;
create trigger stack127_touch_directory_content
after insert or update or delete on public.stack127_directory_pages
for each row execute function public.stack127_touch_directory_content();

create or replace function public.stack127_cache_source_revisions(p_types text[] default null, p_slugs text[] default null)
returns table(entity_type text, slug text, fingerprint text)
language sql stable set search_path = pg_catalog, public as $$
  select 'page', page.slug,
    md5(to_jsonb(page)::text || coalesce(to_jsonb(tool)::text, '') ||
      coalesce((select to_jsonb(directory)::text from public.stack127_directory_pages directory where directory.page_id=page.id), '') ||
      coalesce((select to_jsonb(catalog)::text from public.stack127_catalog_pages catalog
        where catalog.page_id = page.id), '') ||
      coalesce((select string_agg(to_jsonb(member)::text, '' order by member.tool_page_id)
        from public.stack127_tool_catalog_memberships member where member.catalog_page_id = page.id), ''))
  from public.stack127_pages page
  left join public.stack127_tool_pages tool on tool.page_id = page.id
  where (p_types is null or 'page' = any(p_types)) and (p_slugs is null or page.slug = any(p_slugs))
  union all
  select 'self_host_app', app.slug, md5(to_jsonb(app)::text ||
    coalesce((select string_agg(to_jsonb(resource)::text, '' order by to_jsonb(resource)::text)
      from public.self_host_app_resource_estimates resource where resource.app_id = app.id), '') ||
    coalesce((select string_agg(to_jsonb(inst)::text, '' order by to_jsonb(inst)::text)
      from public.self_host_app_install_options inst where inst.app_id = app.id), '') ||
    coalesce((select string_agg(to_jsonb(link)::text, '' order by link.category_id)
      from public.self_host_app_category_links link where link.app_id = app.id), ''))
  from public.self_host_apps app where app.published
    and (p_types is null or 'self_host_app' = any(p_types)) and (p_slugs is null or app.slug = any(p_slugs))
  union all
  select 'cli_apps', 'cli-apps', md5(coalesce(string_agg(md5(to_jsonb(app)::text), '' order by app.slug), ''))
  from public.terminal_apps app
  having (p_types is null or 'cli_apps' = any(p_types)) and (p_slugs is null or 'cli-apps' = any(p_slugs))
  union all
  select 'self_host_catalog', 'all', md5(
    coalesce((select string_agg(md5(to_jsonb(g)::text), '' order by g.id) from public.github_projects g), '') ||
    coalesce((select string_agg(md5(to_jsonb(c)::text), '' order by c.id) from public.self_host_app_categories c), ''))
  where (p_types is null or 'self_host_catalog' = any(p_types)) and (p_slugs is null or 'all' = any(p_slugs))
  union all
  select 'platform_fees', section.id, md5(to_jsonb(section)::text ||
    coalesce((select string_agg(to_jsonb(entry)::text, '' order by entry.id)
      from public.platform_fee_entries entry where entry.section_id = section.id), ''))
  from public.platform_fee_sections section
  where (p_types is null or 'platform_fees' = any(p_types)) and (p_slugs is null or section.id = any(p_slugs))
  union all
  select 'ad_networks', network.slug, md5(to_jsonb(network)::text ||
    coalesce((select string_agg(to_jsonb(relationship)::text || to_jsonb(publisher)::text, '' order by relationship.publisher_id)
      from public.ad_network_publisher_relationships relationship
      join public.ad_network_publishers publisher on publisher.id = relationship.publisher_id
      where relationship.ad_network_id = network.id), ''))
  from public.ad_networks network
  where (p_types is null or 'ad_networks' = any(p_types)) and (p_slugs is null or network.slug = any(p_slugs))
  union all
  select 'launch_directories', 'launch-directories', md5(coalesce(string_agg(to_jsonb(directory)::text, '' order by directory.slug), ''))
  from public.launch_directories directory
  having (p_types is null or 'launch_directories' = any(p_types)) and (p_slugs is null or 'launch-directories' = any(p_slugs))
$$;

notify pgrst, 'reload schema';
commit;
